Z||000008||Gokart||07-04-2000||07:30 AM||||My GT is running really well now with the 180 in. Starts right up like before when I had the 195 in and idles nice too. Didn't notice any performance difference, but just the fact that it's running cooler so I'll leave it in for the summer. Maybe the computer does need time to relearn data when changing thermos? Just wanted to update so not to knock what could be a great thing to do for your Fiero this summer.<P>------------------<BR> Marc                     87GT<p>[This message has been edited by Gokart (edited 07-04-2000).]||||reg||14
